##
    Two projects referencing each other.

    An error, where the same shape between files is only a warning, and the difference is what
    a project is. Files in a circle still all belong to one compilation, so nothing about
    reading them together is in question. A reference crosses from one build to another, and a
    build that has to exist before itself cannot be produced.

    The fix is a third project holding what both need, referenced by both.
##

project Ledger
    reference paired/Reports.pcp
    source ledger
end project
